{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misty's Idle Fishing is an idle desktop fishing game where you help misty on her journey to catch and research all sorts of fish from different islands across the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play on your desktop!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game sits anywhere on your desktop, and the idle gameplay means that Misty can catch fish while you get on with work, watch some videos, or do anything else on your pc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/012821fd4afb01159020fd58bc191906.poster.avif?t=1749850405\" width=520 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/012821fd4afb01159020fd58bc191906.webm?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/012821fd4afb01159020fd58bc191906.mp4?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore 10 Locations!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Misty's boat to explore 10 different locations! Each with their own look, feel and range of fish to catch and research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/9d786cea88b01a56f36373e3fc99d54b.poster.avif?t=1749850405\" width=520 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/9d786cea88b01a56f36373e3fc99d54b.webm?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/9d786cea88b01a56f36373e3fc99d54b.mp4?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase and unlock upgrades!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your research points to improve Misty's fishing gear, letting you catch better fish even faster, store more fish and bait, or get bonus luck! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/b273ae37e8548588a534d677ceeeef7a.poster.avif?t=1749850405\" width=520 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/b273ae37e8548588a534d677ceeeef7a.webm?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/b273ae37e8548588a534d677ceeeef7a.mp4?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Misty's and her boat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert your research points into money, and spend it on customizing Misty's outfit, hairstyle and boat!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/281b5a164707154721dd75ba13ace707.poster.avif?t=1749850405\" width=520 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/281b5a164707154721dd75ba13ace707.webm?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/extras/281b5a164707154721dd75ba13ace707.mp4?t=1749850405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537140?t=1749850405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537140/8a4d0349cf67e535a2284e1667f3e5197a2a0f71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749850405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.